{"version":1,"content":"<p>有「名門獄女」之稱的美國名媛Paris Hilton出名愛炫富，她昨日於社交網分享為女兒倫敦（London）舉辦的童話式生日會照片。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;她留言表示：「為我的小公主London舉行童話式生日會！</p><p>👑🏰💕</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:23:55.561057+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:01:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:17:16.262891+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:17:16.262891+00:00","content_hash":"b773bb7a2373005ef30a5d2f95fc578f069fb6c515738f72e71fee682200a05a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}